{
  "_comment": "Last Sietch server layout. Channels render as '<emoji><separator><name>' to match the Last Sietch Discord style. Edit freely; /channel-template is idempotent (skips anything that already exists). Text names are lowercased/hyphenated by Discord; voice names keep their case. Set a category 'private': true to hide it from @everyone (admins still see it). Set a channel 'readonly': true so @everyone can read but not post (admins/Cielago still post via Administrator).",
